# Netlify Redirects Configuration
# This file handles SPA (Single Page Application) routing

# SPA fallback - all routes should go to index.html for client-side routing
# This allows React Router to handle routing on the client side
/*    /index.html   200

# Optional: Add specific redirects if needed
# Example: Redirect old URLs to new ones
# /old-path    /new-path    301

# Example: Redirect /blog to external URL
# /blog    https://blog.example.com    301
